Measure takes Node
Put Node at "kind" into Kind
If Kind is "file"
Give back Node at "bytes"
Otherwise
Put Node at "left" into LeftNode
Put Node at "right" into RightNode
Call Measure with LeftNode into LeftSize
Call Measure with RightNode into RightSize
Give back LeftSize plus RightSize
Yeah

Rock Readme
Readme at "kind" is "file"
Readme at "bytes" is 2

Rock Api
Api at "kind" is "file"
Api at "bytes" is 3

Rock Guide
Guide at "kind" is "file"
Guide at "bytes" is 5

Rock Docs
Docs at "kind" is "folder"
Docs at "left" is Api
Docs at "right" is Guide

Rock Root
Root at "kind" is "folder"
Root at "left" is Readme
Root at "right" is Docs

Call Measure with Readme into LeafSize
Call Measure with Docs into DocsSize
Call Measure with Root into RootSize

Print "leaf=" plus LeafSize
Print "docs=" plus DocsSize
Print "root=" plus RootSize
